<title>JAPAN: Tokai Bank 6-mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokai Bank 6-mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	   677.65		vs	  874.48</p>
<p> Operating	   76.57		vs	  131.33</p>
<p> Current	     30.14		vs	   33.44</p>
<p> Net		   29.83		vs	    9.77</p>
